    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An unreasonably long woolen scarf, two-tone gray, that occasionally shifts position on its own. Sometimes it tightens against the neck on a cold night. Sometimes it falls off your shoulder for no reason. Sometimes, very quietly, when you are alone in a room, it purrs. The previous owner left it to you. The previous owner was very specific that this was a kindness.</p><p><strong>Companion-Texture.</strong> +1 to Resolve while worn. Once per scene, when you would gain a Stress, you may pet the scarf instead. The Stress is averted. The scarf purrs faintly for a few seconds. Allies notice. Allies do not comment.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    }
  },
